            "review_title": "Review at Old Railway Cafe",
            "review_text": "John P\n98 contributions\n0\nEnjoy the Food and Fun at the Old Railway Café on Train Street\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nTake your life in your hands and go to the Old Quarter Train Street in Hanoi where the long-distance train that connects Hanoi in the north to Ho Chi Minh (Saigon) City in the south. At the café, you can order a fresh and local lunch and drinks, but as the train nears, those on the café tables on the side of the rails have to fold up chairs and stand against the wall while the seemingly endless train passes. The food is fresh and delicious, the beer cold and refreshing, but ask for their top-choice recommendations before you order. Enjoy the food and fun!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGet there early and stay at your table to enjoy the food and drink well before the timetable arrival of the train.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 3, 2025",
