            "review_text": "Will W\nMelbourne, Australia13 contributions\n0\nLovely little spot\nDec 2024 • Family\ngood drinks and lovely atmosphere on train street. cafe located in a great part of train street. staff are efficient in getting you your drinks and making sure all their customers are in a safe position for when the train comes through. would recommend going at around lunch time (11-2) as are most likely to get a good spot (this is when tje street is the least busy). obviously due to location, drinks are not as cheap as at other favourites in hanoi old quarter.\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2024",
